  _sentence:
    CharacterName: Charles
    Text: Think about it. King Grover was old. His health even with the best of doctors
      had been steadily declining. At most he would have lasted a couple more years.
      So why murder him, and in such a gruesome way at that? Why not just wait for
      death to claim him naturally.
    CharacterSprite: {fileID: -5665405108467540286, guid: b60aaaa87db018846be02af70d357078, type: 3}
  ParentNodes:
